{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38079","headline":"余卧疾深村闻一二郎官今称继使闽越笑余迂古潜於异乡闻之因成此篇 · 韩偓","name":"余卧疾深村闻一二郎官今称继使闽越笑余迂古潜於异乡闻之因成此篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枕流方采北山薇，驿骑交迎市道儿。\n雾豹秪忧无石室，泥鰌唯要有洿池。\n不羞莽卓黄金印，却笑羲皇白接䍦。\n莫负美名书信史，清风埽地更无遗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38079.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38079","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}